-- s 111(8)(c): registered post on 1 June, served 3 June
#ASSERT `service takes effect on, mode` `by prepaid registered post` `, sent on` (YMD 2026 6 1) EQUALS YMD 2026 6 3
#ASSERT `service takes effect on, mode` `by fax` `, sent on` (YMD 2026 6 1) EQUALS YMD 2026 6 1
