#ASSERT `hours of notice needed to enter for` `upgrading works (s 84)` EQUALS 48
#ASSERT `hours of notice needed to enter for` `urgent repairs (s 28)` EQUALS 24

§§ `The top-level goal`

GIVEN p IS A `Purchase facts`
      d IS A MAYBE `Dealing facts`
      gs IS A LIST OF `Acquisition ground`
      r IS A `Re-entry facts`
      foreign IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `Flat case`
`flat case` p d gs r foreign MEANS `Flat case` OF p, d, gs, r, foreign, NOTHING

-- an owner who lets the flat to a stranger and mortgages it to a moneylender
`owner X` MEANS `the flat position for` (`flat case` (`purchase` FALSE NOTHING (YMD 2020 1 1) (JUST (YMD 2022 1 1))) (JUST (`dealing` (`using the flat or its proceeds as security for a debt` FALSE) FALSE)) (LIST `(d) a person other than an authorised occupier resides there`) `no re-entry ground` FALSE)
#ASSERT `owner X`'s `entitled to purchase`
#ASSERT `owner X`'s `effect of the dealing` EQUALS JUST `void`
#ASSERT `owner X`'s `protected from bankruptcy and attachment`
#ASSERT `owner X`'s `the Board may compulsorily acquire`
#ASSERT NOT `owner X`'s `the Board may re-enter and determine the lease`
-- non-citizen owners, no dealing, no ground
`owner Y` MEANS `the flat position for` (`flat case` (`purchase` TRUE NOTHING (YMD 2020 1 1) NOTHING) NOTHING EMPTY `no re-entry ground` TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT `owner Y`'s `entitled to purchase`
#ASSERT `owner Y`'s `effect of the dealing` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT NOT `owner Y`'s `protected from bankruptcy and attachment`
#ASSERT NOT `owner Y`'s `the Board may compulsorily acquire`

