#ASSERT NOT `the Board may vest a deceased owner's flat, died` (YMD 2024 1 1) `, representation` (JUST (YMD 2024 11 1)) `, applied for consent` (JUST (YMD 2024 12 1)) `, consent` NOTHING `, completed` NOTHING `, as at` (YMD 2025 5 1)
-- s 63(1)(m): the age limit is for an authorised occupier only; conviction on or after 1 March 1984
