-- s 74: the top-level penalty follows the breach date
`owner Z` MEANS `the flat position for` (`Flat case` OF (`purchase` FALSE NOTHING (YMD 2020 1 1) NOTHING), NOTHING, EMPTY, `no re-entry ground`, FALSE, (JUST (YMD 2015 7 19)))
